From 18a15f425f5d0e9d44934620062f012e79a622d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xnixy <x@ruxn.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:59:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/21] hw/misc/nvfwd: keep a tree of what a guest holds in the
 driver

Each object has its parent and what it is charged, and goes with its parent or
its file, as in the driver. This is how limits on objects and memory are kept,
and how the device knows which handles are the guest's.
---
 hw/misc/nvfwd/meson.build |   1 +
 hw/misc/nvfwd/objects.c   | 217 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/misc/nvfwd/objects.h   |  58 ++++++++++
 3 files changed, 276 insertions(+)
