From d7b3fbc2cff3cc0224da9677d55e7ad1930e343a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xnixy <x@ruxn.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:59:41 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/21] hw/misc/nvfwd: answer a guest's sensor objects here

Nothing a guest does with one reaches the host.
---
 hw/misc/nvfwd/meson.build |   1 +
 hw/misc/nvfwd/sensors.c   | 446 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/misc/nvfwd/sensors.h   |  39 ++++
 3 files changed, 486 insertions(+)
